@startuml SAD_sequence_boot_shutdown
!theme plain
title System Shutdown — Software Architecture
hide footbox

actor "Admin / Signal" as admin
participant "AppRunner" as runner
participant "Audio Playback" as audio
participant "CAN Layer" as can
participant "API / WebSocket" as api
participant "Signal Pipeline" as pipeline

admin -> runner : SIGTERM / SIGINT
runner -> runner : Mark shutdown in progress
runner -> audio : Close audio manager first
audio -> audio : Unsubscribe requests; clear queue;\ncancel audio tasks; stop local player
opt A track was playing
    audio -> can : Attempt final idle feedback\nHMI_AudioTimesamp=-1, HMI_ActiveSoundfile=0 (twice)
end
audio --> runner : Audio cleanup finished
runner -> can : Stop readers and optional simulator
runner -> api : Close camera proxy and WebSocket clients
runner -> pipeline : Stop processing
runner -> api : Request graceful server exit; wait for drain
runner -> runner : Cancel and await remaining owned tasks
runner -> can : Close channel buses and optional simulator bus
runner -> runner : Close reserved API socket
runner --> admin : Shutdown complete

note over audio, can
  Audio stops while the CAN writer and buses are still available.
  Pending tracks cannot start after audio cleanup.
end note
@enduml
